<template><div><h1 id="wiki_main_quest">Main Quest</h1><section><h2 id="details-setup">Open the park and projector room</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-setup-power" data-guide-step>Switch on all five regional supplies: the Spawn employee room by the M1; Journey’s Star Mission/Rover Rampage hallway; Astrocade left of its portal; Polar Peak by Quickies; and Moonlight Cafe upstairs in Kepler. Each switch powers only its own region.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0808.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0808.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Spawn power&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Spawn power&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0808&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0809.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0809.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Journey power&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Journey power&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0809&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0810.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0810.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Astrocade power&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Astrocade power&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0810&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0811.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0811.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Polar Peak power&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Polar Peak power&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0811&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0812.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0812.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Kepler power&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Kepler power&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0812&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-portals" data-guide-step>Activate and travel through Journey, Astrocade, Polar Peak Gift Shop and Kepler’s stair-base portals. The four hub indicators turn blue. Enter Cosmic Way’s central portal to reach the projector; it returns you after its visit window and needs to cool down before reuse.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0813.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0813.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Journey portal&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Journey portal&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0813&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0814.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0814.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Astrocade portal&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Astrocade portal&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0814&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0815.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0815.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Polar Peak portal&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Polar Peak portal&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0815&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0816.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0816.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Kepler portal&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Kepler portal&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0816&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0817.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0817.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Four hub indicators&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Four hub indicators&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0817&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-equipment">Prepare equipment and a Weapon of Rock route</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-equipment-loadout" data-guide-step>Bring an upgraded damage weapon, ammunition and a distraction for the SETI-COM defences. Explosive weapons help keep zombies off the device; Bombstoppers protects against your own explosive splash. Select a Weapon of Rock branch below and save its station-specific coins.</li>
<li id="guide-step-equipment-cores" data-guide-step>Buy an Arcane Core for 300 tickets and activate the UFOs on the projector-room table. Charge one trap in a single use until its UFO leaves orbit, then kill with the Arcane Core weapon near it until it drops an elemental orb. Trap/core pairs: Journey Rocket → Electric; Astrocade Disco → Laser; Polar Steel Dragon → Wind; Kepler Chromosphere → Fire.</li>
<li id="guide-step-equipment-teeth" data-guide-step>Buy Golden Teeth for 300 tickets. Lure a Brute into Kepler’s gator mouth so its teeth break, then fit the replacements. Shoot the throat targets with matching elemental cores: left to right Wind, Electric, Laser, Fire. Take the matching crystal for your selected Weapon of Rock.</li></ol><InlineTool tool="iw-spaceland-souvenirs" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-seticom">Collect and obtain the SETI-COM</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-seticom-calculator" data-guide-step>Collect the calculator from the Cosmic Way bench facing the projector, Astrocade upper trashcan by the broken railing, or Kepler’s yellow table above the ERAD. Only one of its three candidates is used in a match.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0886.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0886.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Calculator: Cosmic Way bench&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Calculator: Cosmic Way bench&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0886&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0887.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0887.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Calculator: upper Astrocade&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Calculator: upper Astrocade&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0887&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0888.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0888.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Calculator: Kepler yellow table&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Calculator: Kepler yellow table&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0888&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-seticom-boombox" data-guide-step>Collect the quest boombox from the lower spawn bridge, Moonlight Cafe counter beside power, or Underground’s Racin’ Stripes room counter. This pickup is separate from a crafted distraction boombox.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0889.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0889.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Boombox: lower bridge&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Boombox: lower bridge&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0889&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0890.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0890.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Boombox: Moonlight Cafe&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Boombox: Moonlight Cafe&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0890&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0891.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0891.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Boombox: Underground counter&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Boombox: Underground counter&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0891&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-seticom-umbrella" data-guide-step>Collect the umbrella from the bench below Hyper Slopes, Journey’s trap control by the card dealer, or Polar Peak’s Gift Shop counter. After the parts are collected, advance a round and wait for the shaking screen and Polar Peak UFO’s four tones.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0892.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0892.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Umbrella: Hyper Slopes&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Umbrella: Hyper Slopes&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0892&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0893.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0893.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Umbrella: Journey control&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Umbrella: Journey control&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0893&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0894.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0894.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Umbrella: Polar Peak&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Umbrella: Polar Peak&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0894&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0895.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0895.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;UFO event landmark&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;UFO event landmark&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0895&quot;}]' /></li>
