<section><h2 id="details-defences">Complete three device defences</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-defences-placements" data-guide-step>Carry the SETI-COM through its seven candidates: Kepler fountain by Bombstoppers; between Kepler’s purple/orange geysers; Polar Gift Shop; Cosmic Way’s Polar entrance; Journey’s Escape Velocity blood pool; Underground break room; and the Bumper Cars entrance. The correct site shakes the screen and offers placement.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0899.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0899.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Placement: Kepler fountain&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Placement: Kepler fountain&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0899&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0900.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0900.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Placement: geysers&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Placement: geysers&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0900&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0901.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0901.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Placement: Polar Gift Shop&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Placement: Polar Gift Shop&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://m