ars&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0905&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-defences-defend" data-guide-step>Place and protect the device through its displayed countdown: first 60 seconds, next 90, final 120. Recover it after each success and collect the dropped Max Ammo. Advance a round between successful defences. Failure spawns a Brute; take a replacement from Hasselhoff and retry that defence on the same round.</li>
<li id="guide-step-defences-return" data-guide-step>After the third success, wait one full round before returning the device to Hasselhoff. Collect the four speakers.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0906.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0906.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Four speakers&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Four speakers&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:407,&quot;height&quot;:385,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0906&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-speakers">Place and record the speaker layout</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-speakers-place" data-guide-step>Place speakers on Cosmic Way’s three golden region symbols and in front of the projector gateway. Prepare before interacting with a speaker: activation seals you inside the Cosmic Way/Spawn arena.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0907.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0907.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Three golden placement symbols&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Three golden placement symbols&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0907&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0908.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0908.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Gateway speaker position&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Gateway speaker position&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0908&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-speakers-layout" data-guide-step>Activate a speaker and record each physical position’s Red, Blue, Yellow or Green beam. Assign speaker numbers using the same orientation throughout the attempt; the colours are not permanently assigned to map positions.</li></ol><InlineTool tool="iw-spaceland-speakers" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-ufo-sequences">Repeat three UFO colour sequences</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-ufo-sequences-repeat" data-guide-step>Watch every UFO flash, including repeated colours. When the UFO and speakers turn white, enter the full order at the corresponding physical speakers. Complete three successful sequences. Co-op has a shorter response window, so assign positions beforehand.</li>
<li id="guide-step-ufo-sequences-retry" data-guide-step>If the sequence was missed, let the next display show it again. A wrong or partly entered response can spawn a Brute; clear it and replay the renewed display. Retain the speaker layout and reset only the recorded sequence.</li></ol><InlineTool tool="iw-spaceland-speakers" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-aliens">Break the alien backpack fuses</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-aliens-collar" data-guide-step>After the clown wave, fight the aliens emerging from the gateway; their number follows player count. Shoot each glowing neck collar. Green/yellow/red are damage-state cues. Keep moving clear of its energy shots and zombies appearing close to you.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0909.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0909.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Alien encounter&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Alien encounter&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0909&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0910.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0910.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Glowing neck collar&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Glowing neck collar&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:149,&quot;height&quot;:169,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0910&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-aliens-fuse-melee" data-guide-step>When an alien kneels, reach its backpack and melee the exposed fuse promptly. Confirm the breaking sound and its recovery, then repeat the damage/downing cycle. The last downing kills it without another fuse melee. Finish every alien.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0911.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0911.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Alien downed backpack window&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Alien downed backpack window&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0911&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-fuses">Upgrade the projector and Weapon of Rock</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-fuses-projector-fuses" data-guide-step>Take the alien fuses in front of the gateway and install them in the projector. This unlocks the current match’s upgraded projector. Craft your chosen Weapon of Rock if it is still incomplete, then upgrade it here for 5,000 points.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0912.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0912.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Alien fuses&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Alien fuses&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0912&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0913.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0913.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Upgraded projector&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Upgraded projector&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0913&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-laser">Destroy the overhead UFO and claim the ending</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-laser-nodes" data-guide-step>Shoot four of the five bridge-ring nodes with the upgraded Weapon of Rock. They glow orange. Watch the UFO’s path over the projector and time the fifth node so the charged ring’s upward beam intersects it. A miss requires another charged attempt, not a claimed completion.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0914.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0914.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Five Spaceland ring nodes&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Five Spaceland ring nodes&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1191,&quot;height&quot;:1146,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0914&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0915.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0915.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Orange active node&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Orange active node&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0915&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-laser-soul-key" data-guide-step>After the UFO ignites and explodes, collect the Soul Key in front of the gateway. In Director’s Cut, also take the talisman appearing there after the key. The special final cutscene requires the unlocked Wyler character branch.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0916.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0916.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Soul Key&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Soul Key&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0916&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0917.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0917.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Director’s Cut talisman&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Director’s Cut talisman&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0917&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_side_quests">Side Quests</h1><section><h2 id="details-head-cutter">Head-Cutter · Wind / yellow crystal</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-head-cutter-battery" data-guide-step>Buy Cryo Grenades (350 tickets) and throw one into the Polar entrance yeti’s face. Lure ten zombies through its cold breath and headshot the frozen targets. After the roar, collect the battery from the Gift Shop yeti’s hand.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0840.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0840.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Cryo Grenade purchase&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Cryo Grenade purchase&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0840&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0841.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0841.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Polar entrance yeti&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Polar entrance yeti&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0841&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0842.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0842.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Battery pickup&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Battery pickup&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0842&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-head-cutter-plush" data-guide-step>Insert three Green coins at Polar Peak’s souvenir station and take the Yeti Plush. Obtain the Wind-core yellow crystal from the gator’s leftmost target, then place all three parts at the Gift Shop Octonian cutout.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0843.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0843.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Yeti Plush&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Yeti Plush&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0843&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0849.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0849.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Head-Cutter assembly cutout&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Head-Cutter assembly cutout&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0849&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-face-melter">Face-Melter · Electric / blue crystal</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-face-melter-battery" data-guide-step>With the hub projector open, throw a standard grenade into Journey’s active portal. Relay the returned red grenade toward the hub by picking it up and throwing it before it explodes; each pickup refreshes its fuse. Throw it through the hub gateway and recover the battery where it lands.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0850.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0850.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Returned red grenade&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Returned red grenade&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0850&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0851.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0851.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Face-Melter battery&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Face-Melter battery&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0851&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-face-melter-toy" data-guide-step>Insert three Blue coins at Journey’s station for the rocket toy. Take the Electric-core crystal from the gator’s second target and assemble at the Escape Velocity cutout.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0852.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0852.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Rocket toy&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Rocket toy&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0852&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0853.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0853.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Face-Melter cutout&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Face-Melter cutout&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0853&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-dischord">Dischord · Laser / green crystal</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-dischord-targets" data-guide-step>Pick up zombie-dropped sunglasses and wear them to see five randomly selected targets. Search the Spawn hedge; Cosmic Way ATM, Polar bridge and mountain-mouth sign; Astrocade power, claw machine, Cryptid window, prize floor, Black Hole trashcan and alien cutout; rear store/bumper cars; and the Polar yeti walkway. Shoot all five and collect the battery on the Astrocade dance floor. If hit, recover dropped glasses quickly.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0854.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0854.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sunglasses&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sunglasses&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0854&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0855.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0855.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Spawn target&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Spawn target&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0855&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0857.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0857.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Polar bridge target&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Polar bridge target&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0857&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0860.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0860.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Astrocade power target&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Astrocade power target&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0860&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0861.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0861.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Claw machine target&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Claw machine target&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0861&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0870.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0870.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Dischord battery&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Dischord battery&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0870&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-dischord-disco" data-guide-step>Insert one Red, one Green and one Blue coin at the rear Astrocade station. Take its Disco Ball and the Laser-core crystal from the gator’s third target; assemble by the Astrocade prize-counter cutout.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0871.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0871.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Disco Ball&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Disco Ball&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0871&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0872.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0872.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Dischord cutout&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Dischord cutout&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0872&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-shredder">Shredder · Fire / red crystal</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-shredder-battery" data-guide-step>Shoot the battery on the back-middle of Kepler’s log-ride boat. At the geysers above the river, catch the battery as it shoots upward. Waiting beside one geyser is easier than chasing each burst.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0873.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0873.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Log-ride battery&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Log-ride battery&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0873&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0874.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0874.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Geyser battery catch&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Geyser battery catch&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0874&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-shredder-alien" data-guide-step>Insert three Red coins at Kepler’s souvenir station. Take the Alien Souvenir and Fire-core crystal from the gator’s rightmost target; assemble at the Underground/log-ride cutout.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0875.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0875.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Alien Souvenir&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Alien Souvenir&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0875&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0876.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0876.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Shredder cutout&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Shredder cutout&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0876&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-n31l">N31L assistance and K.I.T.T.</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-n31l-head" data-guide-step>Fit the ice-cream stand’s N31L head below Hyper Slopes onto his Cosmic Way body. Complete his five displayed challenges; interact to summon Hasselhoff. You can pause his current challenge through interaction.</li>
<li id="guide-step-n31l-upgrades" data-guide-step>After his return, fit the auxiliary battery (check Kepler’s ice-cream cart/bench/trashcan and Polar’s trashcan/cubbies/counter). Finish the next challenge set and summon again. After that return, find the Underground floppy at the HVR workbench, Racin’ Stripes bench or Banshee table. Finish the final set and summon once more; subsequent summons cost 5,000.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-ghosts-n-skulls">Ghosts ’N Skulls · optional permanent-perk route</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-ghosts-n-skulls-first-skulls" data-guide-step>Pop all balloons above Spawn’s Hailstorm. Find successive skulls in sign letters spelling GHOST: G Galaxy Journey/Roller Rampage; H Chromosphere/Hyper Slopes; O Journey Into Space/Cosmic Tunes; S Star Mission/rear Astrocade; T Octonian Hunter/Moonlight Cafe. Stare at each until it breaks. On the dance floor, kill exactly 1 on Green, 9 on Blue, 8 on Pink and 4 on unlit Black in that order; restart at Green after an incorrect count.</li>
<li id="guide-step-ghosts-n-skulls-arcade" data-guide-step>Complete the skull event on Basketball, Black Hole (50 points), Cryptid Attack, Zombie Zoom and Bowling for Planets. Finish the main quest, keep sunglasses on and use the ring laser to destroy the sky skull over the gateway. Finally bait a Brute’s laser into the upstairs Ghosts ’N Skulls cabinet.</li>
<li id="guide-step-ghosts-n-skulls-minigame" data-guide-step>All players enter the energized cabinet. Entangle floating ghosts and fire them at skulls through three rounds; prioritize escaping red skulls. Three escaped skulls fail a round. Re-energize with the Brute laser to retry. Completion grants permanent perks, with solo Up ’N Atoms excluded.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-music-and-characters">Music and character unlocks</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-music-and-characters-songs" data-guide-step>For the MW1 mix, shoot the teddy pictures on three active Employee of the Month boards. For the MW2 mix, shoot five hidden teddy bears; an absent fifth bear may require a new match. These music hunts are independent of the quest.</li>
<li id="guide-step-music-and-characters-hoff-code" data-guide-step>After earning this map’s Soul Key, select it in the lobby and enter Left, Right, Left, Up, Down. Confirm Hasselhoff’s icon before starting; opening another lobby menu can clear the selection.</li>
<li id="guide-step-music-and-characters-wyler" data-guide-step>After the separate Director’s Cut/Mephistopheles unlock, activate Director’s Cut on Spaceland and enter Left, Left, Down, Up, Up, Right. Completing Spaceland as Wyler after the required finale grants the special ending and Willard’s Test reward.</li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Source-reviewed on 8 October 2026, using the references below and the research handoff. These instructions and puzzle calculations have software checks; they have not been verified in a complete in-game playthrough. Record symbols, sequences and completion cues from your match. Screenshot and community-chart creators are credited with each illustration.</p><ul><li><a href="https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/zombies_in_spaceland/zombies_in_spaceland_guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Illustrated quest and equipment reference · mmmrkennedy ↗</a></li>
